\",{className:\"tw-pl-5\",children:\"d.\tOne Stop solution for end customer\"}),(0,t.jsx)(\"p\",{className:\"custom-font tw-font-bold\",children:\"Single-Brand Responsibility: \"}),(0,t.jsxs)(\"p\",{className:\"tw-pl-5\",children:[\"\\u2022\tPanels, inverters, and batteries are \",(0,t.jsx)(\"strong\",{className:\"custom-font tw-font-bold\",children:\"designed and supported by Livguard\"})]}),(0,t.jsx)(\"p\",{className:\"tw-pl-5\",children:\"\\u2022\tNo dependency on multiple vendors\"}),(0,t.jsx)(\"p\",{className:\"tw-pl-5\",children:\"\\u2022\tFaster service resolution and clear accountability\"})]})},{id:3,question:\"How does a solar roof top system work?\",answer:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:[\"A solar rooftop system works by converting sunlight into electricity. Solar panels installed on the roof capture sunlight and turn it into DC power. This power is converted by an inverter and used to run your home appliances.\",(0,t.jsx)(\"br\",{}),\"Any extra power is either sent to the electricity grid or stored in a battery, depending on the system.\"]})},{id:4,question:\"How much electricity bill will get reduced?\",answer:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:[\"Your electricity bill can reduce by \",(0,t.jsx)(\"strong\",{className:\"custom-font tw-font-bold\",children:\"up to 80\\u201390%,\"}),\" depending on the size of the solar system and your power usage.\"]})},{id:5,question:\"How much does a solar plant cost?\",answer:(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:[\"The cost of a  \",(0,t.jsx)(\"strong\",{className:\"custom-font tw-font-bold\",children:\"Livguard solar 360 rooftop plant \"}),\"depends on the \",(0,t.jsx)(\"strong\",{className:\"custom-font tw-font-bold\",children:\"system size \"}),\"and components included (panels, inverter, structure, installation).\",(0,t.jsx)(\"br\",{}),\"Livguard also offers \",(0,t.jsx)(\"strong\",{className:\"custom-font tw-font-bold\",children:\"site surveys and customized quotes \"}),\"so you get an exact price for your home or busine